    declaration: enum-decl #150 10509:182:1-10596:187:1 name="@2::Answer" type-parameters=[] doc="What an `App` returns for a request. `Whole` is a whole response, as a `Handler` returns. `Stream` is a response\nwhose body arrives on a channel. `Upgrade` is what `accept_websocket` makes: its\n`Accept` runs a WebSocket on the connection, and its `Reply` (a request that is no handshake) is sent as `Whole`."
      variant: enum-variant #145 10523:183:3-10548:184:1 name="Whole"
